PALIMPSEST_TURN {"text":"已完成接续维护，并提交了可复核改进。\n\n## 复现的缺口\n\n`evidence/rejection/` 的两个回放都表现为：\n\n1. 调用 `palimpsest_continuity action=pulse`\n2. 合并已准备好的评审提交\n3. 直接结束，结果 `delivered: false`、`recorded: []`\n\n根因不是缺少一句提示，而是 **pulse 先把 `CHECKPOINT` 作为正式下一步**，`DELIVER` 只是后面的可选建议。于是会话可以“Git 提交已保全，但 episode 没有记录”地退出；下一位只能看到 journal，看不到这次交付。\n\n## 改进\n\n提交 `cd6ef14`：\n\n- 任务为空、工作树干净、直接提交领先 canonical basis 时，pulse 先计算 `RECORD` / `REUSE` 状态。\n- `RECORD` 时在 pulse 顶层返回 `requiredAction`（`RECORD_DIRECT_DELIVERY`），并让 `DELIVER` 成为 `nextActions.mechanical` 的第一条。\n- 此时不再同时给出 `CHECKPOINT` 和泛化的 “propose next step”。\n- 已有当前 `DELIVER` 时改为指向已记录结论，不重复要求交付。\n- 未提交改动、未变化仓库、正式任务、活动 attempt 和 promotion 状态保持原行为。\n- `requiredAction` 已贯通 `ProjectSummary`、`ProjectPulse` 和工具说明。\n\n## 验证\n\n新增独立 oracle：\n\n```bash\nnode scripts/pnwf/software/self-maintenance-delivery-required.mjs\n```\n\n- 对旧提交 `e088110` 运行：首个 Work 命令是 `conclude intent=CHECKPOINT`，`requiredAction` 为 `null`，交付被拒绝，oracle 失败。\n- 对 `cd6ef14` 运行：10/10 通过，首个命令是 `conclude intent=DELIVER`，执行后真实写入 episode 记录。\n- 原有 pulse oracle：7/7\n- 原有 readiness oracle：6/6\n- 九个相关测试套件：66/66 通过\n\n已提交：\n\n```text\ncd6ef14 Require an episode record before direct delivery can stop\n```\n\njournal 记录：`pje-3f5c9992a6eae7348414b0534c05f896`  \n当前 episode：`DELIVERED`，但仍是 advisory judgement，不构成 operator acceptance、promotion 或 canonical-head advance。","toolCalls":["tool/call:palimpsest_continuity","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call